@segment  campfire-closure
@title    Astral Campfire — Gratitude and Closure
@levels   F15
@shelved  source session removed by user on 2026-08-22
@duration ~2m

say Before you depart, take a moment to acknowledge those who joined you.
pause 6
say Offer thanks for their presence, in whatever way feels natural. No words are necessary. Intent is enough.
pause 12
say Now, turn your attention back to the fire.
pause 4
say Watch as the flames begin to fold in upon themselves. The light dims, the heat fades, and the entire fireplace resets.
pause 8
say The void absorbs it back into nothingness. In its place, a new unlit fireplace forms. Clear, and untouched.
pause 6
say It shimmers for a moment like a mirage, then ripples away into silence.
pause 6
say The space is reset, and left just as you found it.
pause 8
